  "prefLabel": "Env-Hw 103.46 EPA hazardous waste number",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Hw 103.46 “EPA hazardous waste number” means the number assigned by EPA to each EPA hazardous waste identified in Env-Hw 400.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100) #12343, eff 8-14-17; (formerly Env-Hw 103.44, renumbered by #12920) (See Revision Note #3 at chapter heading for Env-Hw 100)",
